      "excerpt": "| Discography Production discography Sexual misconduct allegations | | Studio albums | No Way Out \"No Way Out (Puff Daddy album)\") Forever \"Forever (Puff Daddy album)\") The Saga Continues... Press Play \"Press Play (album)\") The Love Album: Off the Grid | | Mixtapes | MMM (Money Making Mitch) \"MMM (Money Making Mitch)\") | | Remix albums | We Invented the Remix | [...] | Jadakiss Sheek Louch Styles P | | Studio albums | Money, Power & Respect (1998) We Are the Streets (2000) Filthy America... It'…",
